pan></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold font-sans text-gray-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight leading-tight\">Komitmen Pelayanan Ibadah <span class=\"text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027]\">Amanah Safar Marhaban</span></h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base\">Empat pilar utama ikhtiar kami dalam menghadirkan perjalanan ibadah suci yang tenang, nyaman, dan khusyuk.</p></div><div class=\"hidden sm:grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-[#FAFAFD] dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-7 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-2xs space-y-4 hover:border-purple-200 dark:hover:border-purple-800 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#4B2476]/10 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] group-hover:bg-[#4B2476] dark:group-hover:bg-[#F5B027] group-hover:text-[#F5B027] dark:group-hover:text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] bg-purple-50 dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-purple-100 dark:border-slate-700\">Pendampingan Syari&#x27;ah</span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-[#4B2476] dark:group-hover:text-[#F5B027] transition-colors leading-snug\">Bimbingan Ibadah Sesuai Sunnah &amp; Manasik Intensif</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">Didampingi oleh Muthawwif &amp; Tour Leader berpengalaman yang siap membimbing setiap rukun umrah dengan sabar, ramah, dan sesuai tuntunan Al-Qur&#x27;an serta As-Sunnah.</p></div><div class=\"pt-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Komitmen Resmi Marhaban</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#FAFAFD] dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-7 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-2xs space-y-4 hover:border-purple-200 dark:hover:border-purple-800 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#4B2476]/10 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] group-hover:bg-[#4B2476] dark:group-hover:bg-[#F5B027] group-hover:text-[#F5B027] dark:group-hover:text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 12h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 8h4\"></path><path d=\"M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3\"></path><path d=\"M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] bg-purple-50 dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-purple-100 dark:border-slate-700\">Kemudahan Akses Ibadah</span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-[#4B2476] dark:group-hover:text-[#F5B027] transition-colors leading-snug\">Kenyamanan Akomodasi Strategis Dekat Masjid</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">Pilihan hotel bintang 4 &amp; 5 berlokasi strategis di area pelataran Makkah &amp; Madinah untuk kemudahan akses ibadah jamaah, terutama bagi orang tua dan lansia.</p></div><div class=\"pt-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Komitmen Resmi Marhaban</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#FAFAFD] dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-7 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-2xs space-y-4 hover:border-purple-200 dark:hover:border-purple-800 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#4B2476]/10 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] group-hover:bg-[#4B2476] dark:group-hover:bg-[#F5B027] group-hover:text-[#F5B027] dark:group-hover:text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plane w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.8 19.2 16 11l3.5-3.5C21 6 21.5 4 21 3c-1-.5-3 0-4.5 1.5L13 8 4.8 6.2c-.5-.1-.9.1-1.1.5l-.3.5c-.2.5-.1 1 .3 1.3L9 12l-2 3H4l-1 1 3 2 2 3 1-1v-3l3-2 3.5 5.3c.3.4.8.5 1.3.3l.5-.2c.4-.3.6-.7.5-1.2z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] bg-purple-50 dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-purple-100 dark:border-slate-700\">Perjalanan Nyaman</span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-[#4B2476] dark:group-hover:text-[#F5B027] transition-colors leading-snug\">Kepastian Penerbangan Maskapai Terpercaya</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">Pengurusan dokumen, pemvisaan resmi Kemenag, serta tiket penerbangan direct flight menggunakan maskapai ternama seperti Saudia Airlines &amp; Garuda Indonesia.</p></div><div class=\"pt-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Komitmen Resmi Marhaban</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#FAFAFD] dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-7 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-2xs space-y-4 hover:border-purple-200 dark:hover:border-purple-800 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#4B2476]/10 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] group-hover:bg-[#4B2476] dark:group-hover:bg-[#F5B027] group-hover:text-[#F5B027] dark:group-hover:text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart-handshake w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19.414 14.414C21 12.828 22 11.5 22 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-9.591-3.676.6.6 0 0 1-.818.001A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 9.5c0 2.3 1.5 4 3 5.5l5.535 5.362a2 2 0 0 0 2.879.052 2.12 2.12 0 0 0-.004-3 2.124 2.124 0 1 0 3-3 2.124 2.124 0 0 0 3.004 0 2 2 0 0 0 0-2.828l-1.881-1.882a2.41 2.41 0 0 0-3.409 0l-1.71 1.71a2 2 0 0 1-2.828 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.828l2.823-2.762\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] bg-purple-50 dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-purple-100 dark:border-slate-700\">Ketenangan Jamaah</span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-[#4B2476] dark:group-hover:text-[#F5B027] transition-colors leading-snug\">Kejelasan Biaya &amp; Catering Menu Nusantara</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">Informasi rincian biaya disampaikan secara terbuka tanpa biaya tersembunyi, lengkap dengan sajian hidangan catering makanan cita rasa Indonesia 3x sehari.</p></div><div class=\"pt-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Komitmen Resmi Marhaban</span></div></div></div><div class=\"sm:hidden space-y-4\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-[#FAFAFD] dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-md min-h-[240px] flex flex-col justify-between\"><div class=\"space-y-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-[#4B2476] dark:bg-[#F5B027] text-[#F5B027] dark:text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center font-bold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] bg-purple-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Pendampingan Syari&#x27;ah</span></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white leading-snug\">Bimbingan Ibadah Sesuai Sunnah &amp; Manasik Intensif</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">Didampingi oleh Muthawwif &amp; Tour Leader berpengalaman yang siap membimbing setiap rukun umrah dengan sabar, ramah, dan sesuai tuntunan Al-Qur&#x27;an serta As-Sunnah.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-4 border-t border-gray-200/80 dark:border-slate-800\"><span class=\"text-xs font-extrabold text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027]\">Pilar <!-- -->1<!-- --> dari <!-- -->4</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-white flex items-center justify-center border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-2xs focus:outline-none\" aria-label=\"Sebelumnya\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-left w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"flex gap-1\"><button class=\"h-2 rounded-full transition-all w-4 bg-[#4B2476] dark:bg-[#F5B027]\" aria-label=\"Slide 1\"></button><button class=\"h-2 rounded-full transition-all w-2 bg-gray-300 dark:bg-slate-700\" aria-label=\"Slide 2\"></button><button class=\"h-2 rounded-full transition-all w-2 bg-gray-300 dark:bg-slate-700\" aria-label=\"Slide 3\"></button><button class=\"h-2 rounded-full transition-all w-2 bg-gray-300 dark:bg-slate-700\" aria-label=\"Slide 4\"></button></div><button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-white flex items-center justify-center border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-2xs focus:outline-none\" aria-label=\"Selanjutnya\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"programs\" class=\"py-16 sm:py-28 bg-gray-50/70 dark:bg-slate-950/60 transition-colors duration-300\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 space-y-3\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-[#4B2476] dark:text-purple-300 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-luggage w-4 h-4 text-[#F5B027]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 20a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2\"></path><path d=\"M8 18V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14\"></path><path d=\"M10 20h4\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Katalog Program 