eeb?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Umrah Reguler Direct Flight (9 Hari)\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-black/20 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 right-4 text-white flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md\">9 Hari 8 Malam</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[#F5B027] text-xs font-bold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-[#F5B027]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><span>5<!-- --> (<!-- -->48<!-- -->)</span></div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 space-y-4\"><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-xl text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-[#4B2476] dark:group-hover:text-[#F5B027] transition-colors leading-snug\">Umrah Reguler Direct Flight (9 Hari)</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 line-clamp-2\">Program ibadah populer dengan penerbangan direct flight tanpa transit &amp; lokasi hotel strategis dekat pelataran utama.</p><div class=\"space-y-2 bg-[#FAFAFD] dark:bg-slate-800/60 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\