#F5B027] text-gray-900 border-[#F5B027] shadow-md font-extrabold\"><span class=\"truncate\">Saudia Airlines (Direct)</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-3.5 h-3.5 text-gray-900 shrink-0 ml-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-3 px-4 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all text-left flex items-center justify-between border bg-white/10 text-white border-white/15 hover:bg-white/20\"><span class=\"truncate\">Garuda Indonesia (Direct)</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-3 px-4 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all text-left flex items-center justify-between border bg-white/10 text-white border-white/15 hover:bg-white/20\"><span class=\"truncate\">Emirates (Transit VIP)</span></button></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/10 dark:bg-slate-900/70 backdrop-blur-md p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/15 space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><label class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#F5B027] flex items-center gap-2 uppercase tracking-wider\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><span>4. Jumlah Rombongan</span></label><span class=\"text-sm font-extrabold text-white bg-white/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2<!-- --> Orang Jamaah</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 font-bold text-xl text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-colors\">-</button><input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" class=\"w-full accent-[#F5B027] cursor-pointer\" value=\"2\"/><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 font-bold text-xl text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-colors\">+</button></div></div><div class=\"pt-4 text-center\"><button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-[#F5B027] hover:bg-amber-500 text-gray-900 font-extrabold text-sm sm:text-base px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xl transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-send w-5 h-5 text-gray-900\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg><span>Minta Penawaran Custom via WhatsApp</span></button></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"testimonials\" class=\"py-16 sm:py-28 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-950/60 relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 space-y-3\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-950/60 text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart w-4 h-4 text-[#F5B027]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg><span>Kisah Kebahagiaan Jamaah</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold font-sans text-gray-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight\">Apa Kata Jamaah <span class=\"text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027]\">Amanah Safar Marhaban</span>?</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base\">Ulasan jujur dari jamaah yang telah mempercayakan perjalanan ibadah sucinya bersama kami.</p></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto relative\"><div class=\"flex gap-6 overflow-x-auto snap-x snap-mandatory pb-4 scrollbar-none sm:overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"min-w-full sm:min-w-full snap-center bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between relative block\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote w-12 h-12 text-purple-100 dark:text-slate-800 absolute top-6 right-6 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[#F5B027] mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-[#F5B027]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-[#F5B027]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-[#F5B027]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-[#F5B027]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-[#F5B027]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 ml-2\">Keberangkatan Ramadhan 1447 H</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed italic mb-8 relative z-10\">&quot;<!-- -->Alhamdulillah perjalanan Umrah bersama Amanah Safar Marhaban sangat berkesan. Hotel di Makkah persis di depan pelataran Masjidil Haram sehingga orang tua kami yang sepuh tidak lelah sama sekali. Muthawwif masyaAllah sangat sabar membimbing sesuai sunnah.<!-- -->&quot;</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#4B2476] dark:bg-[#F5B027] text-[#F5B027] dark:text-gray-900 font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-md\">H</div><div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white text-base flex items-center gap-1\"><span>H. Ahmad Subandi &amp; Keluarga</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></h3><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 block\">Jakarta Selatan<!-- --> • <strong class=\"text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027]\">Umrah Reguler VIP 12 Hari</strong></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"min-w-full sm:min-w-full snap-center bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between relative hidden sm:hidden\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote w-12 h-12 text-purple-100 dark:text-slate-800 absolute top-6 right-6 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[#F5B027] mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-[#F5B027]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-