22 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-[#F5B027]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 ml-2\">Keberangkatan Februari 2026</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed italic mb-8 relative z-10\">&quot;<!-- -->Penerbangan Saudia Airlines direct tanpa transit membuat perjalanan terasa begitu cepat dan nyaman. Makanan catering nusantara di hotel rasanya lezat mirip masakan rumah. Terima kasih Tim Marhaban yang amanah!<!-- -->&quot;</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#4B2476] dark:bg-[#F5B027] text-[#F5B027] dark:text-gray-900 font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-md\">H</div><div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white text-base flex items-center gap-1\"><span>Hj. Siti Rahmah, M.Pd.</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></h3><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 block\">Bandung<!-- --> • <strong class=\"text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027]\">Umrah Reguler Hemat 9 Hari</strong></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"min-w-full sm:min-w-full snap-center bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between relative hidden sm:hidden\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote w-12 h-12 text-purple-100 dark:text-slate-800 absolute top-6 right-6 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[#F5B027] mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 fill-[#F5B027]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"r